  "AI-specific permissions (reading, summarization, RAG, training) are declared machine-readably in /.well-known/aicr.json and /.well-known/aicl.json. In short: reading, summarizing, quoting, and RAG with attribution are welcome; model training and commercial redistribution require contact.": "Permisonan specífiko pa AI (lesamento, resumimento, RAG, entrenamento) ta wordu declará di manera lesibel pa mashin den /.well-known/aicr.json i /.well-known/aicl.json. Na cortico: lesamento, resumimento, citacion, i RAG ku atribucion ta bonbiní; entrenamento di modelo i redistribucion comercial ta requerí kontakto.",
  "AI: The Washington Report — July 2026 Edition": "AI: The Washington Report — July 2026 Edition",
  "AICL generator": "AICL generator",
  "AICL is a protocol proposal — it does not guarantee that AI companies will pay.": "AICL ta un proposicion di protocolo — e no ta garantisá ku compañianan di AI lo paga.",
  "AICL is the licensing and transaction layer built on top of AICR. Where AICR declares what is allowed, AICL defines how permission is actually obtained: license tiers and prices, quote and payment endpoints, signed license tokens, usage and audit logs, and revocation. It is designed to interoperate with emerging machine-payment mechanisms such as HTTP 402 flows and pay-per-crawl schemes, with agentic payment kept inside human-approved budgets and audit trails.": "AICL ta e kapa di licenciamento i transaccion construí ariba AICR. Unda AICR ta declará kico ta permití, AICL ta definí con e permiso realmente ta wordu obtení: nivelnan di licencia i prijs, endpointnan di kotisacion i pago, tokennan di licencia firmá, registronan di uso i auditoria, i revocacion. E ta wordu diseñá pa interoperá ku mecanismonan nobo di pago di mashin manera fluhonan HTTP 402 i sistemanan pay-per-crawl, ku pago di agente keda dentro di presupuesto aprobá pa hende i registronan di auditoria.",
