  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Ehèmpelnan di códigu, JSON Schemas, i plantia di polítika lesibel pa mashin ta licenciá bou di e Licencia MIT, sino ku ta indicá otro manera. Bo por implementá nan riba bo mes sitionan librementer.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Punto di entrada combiná di derecho",
  "Commercial Redistribution": "Redistribucion Comercial",
  "Commercial use": "Uso comercial",
  "Commercial use requires contact": "Uso comercial ta requerí kontakto",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Encargá despues di e Cumbre di Seguridad di AI di Bletchley i dirigí pa Yoshua Bengio ku mas di 100 experto contribuyente for di casi 30 pais mas Nashonnan Uní, OECD i UE, e informe independiente aki ta sintetisá evidencia científico actual tocante capacidad i riesgo di AI di frontera — remarcando ku algun sistema awor por detektá ora nan ta wordu evaluá i ahustá nan comportamento di acuerdo.",
  "Companion media": "Media di acompañamento",
  "Compensation models tied to learning depth": "Modelonan di kompensacion ligá na profundidad di siña",
  "Conditions (comma-separated)": "Condicionnan (separá pa coma)",
  "Consciousness": "Consciencia",
