  "UI": "UI",
  "Undefined openness reads as legal uncertainty to AI pipelines and gets cleaned out; only protocolized, machine-readable permission makes content genuinely learnable.": "Abertura no definí ta lesa komo inseguridad hurídiko pa pipelinenan di AI i ta wordu limpiá afó; solamente permiso protocolisá i lesibel pa mashin ta hasi kontenido genuinamente aprendibel.",
