  "Web fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which receives standard font requests from your browser. No other third-party scripts are used.": "Fuentenan web ta wordu cargá for di Google Fonts, ku ta risibí petitionnan standard di fuente for di bo browser. Ningun otro script di tercero no ta wordu usá.",
  "What AI systems may do with content: read, summarize, transform, retrieve, train, commercialize, redistribute. The AICR ruleset and the AICL licensing layer make these rights declarable and transactable.": "Kico sistemanan di AI por hasi ku kontenido: lesa, resumí, transformá, rekuperá, entrená, comercialisá, redistribuí. E reglanan di AICR i e kapa di licenciamento di AICL ta hasi e derechonan aki declarabel i transaccionabel.",
  "What a server can return when an AI crawler requests licensed content without a license token — a machine-actionable quote instead of a dead end.": "Kico un servidor por retorná ora un crawler di AI ta pidi kontenido licenciá sin un token di licencia — un kotisacion ehekutabel pa mashin en bes di un caminda sera.",
  "What this site is": "Kico e sitio aki ta",
