  "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration": "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration",
  "Whether AI may learn, to what depth, for which purposes, and under what obligations. Being read is not being learned from; \"not prohibited\" is not \"learnable\". AIRS and AILP turn learning permission into a graduated, machine-readable spectrum.": "Si AI por siña, te ki profundidad, pa ki propósito, i bou di ki obligacion. Wordu lesá no ta wordu usá pa siña; “no prohibí” no ta “aprendibel”. AIRS i AILP ta convertí permiso di siña den un spektro gradual i lesibel pa mashin.",
