  "Why a single allow/deny bit cannot govern AI-era content use — and what a rights layer looks like instead.": "Pakiko un solo bit di permití/nenga no por gobernaí uso di kontenido den era di AI — i con un kapa di derecho ta parce en bes.",
  "Why undefined openness gets cleaned out of training pipelines": "Pakiko abertura no definí ta wordu limpiá afó di pipelinenan di entrenamento",
  "Wilks, Ladak, and Loughnan (University of Edinburgh) argue that philosophical debate over AI consciousness overlooks psychological research on animal ethics — the same cognitive and social biases that limit moral consideration for animals will likely limit it for AI too, regardless of whether AI ever becomes conscious.": "Wilks, Ladak, i Loughnan (University of Edinburgh) ta argumentá ku debate filosófico riba consciencia di AI ta pasa over investigacion psicológico riba étika di animal — e mesun bias cognitivo i social ku ta limitá consideracion moral pa animal probablemente lo limitá'e pa AI tambe, sin importá si AI algun biaha bira consciente.",
